# together: this block uncommented, AUTHELIA_DOMAIN set in .env (plus its
# DNS record), and ADMIN_AUTH_SNIPPET=forward_auth_gate in .env. See
# README "Optional: two-factor authentication" — do that first, since this
# alone doesn't start the "2fa" compose profile.
